# >>> syndicate artifact-guard baseline (seeded once by /distribute-defaults / /setup) >>>
# SEED-ONCE: the distribution engine appends this block only if the marker is absent; it does
# NOT refresh an existing block. To change the baseline fleet-wide, edit central AND update each
# project's block by hand (or delete the block so the next distribution re-seeds it).
# Kept in sync with the patterns in .claude/hooks/pre-commit (ARTIFACT_EXT/DIR/EGG/BIN).
# NOTE: .gitignore does NOT untrack files already in git. An artifact already tracked
# must be removed with `git rm --cached <path>` (these patterns only stop FUTURE staging).
# The pre-commit hook is the mechanical backstop; intentional exceptions go in
# .claude/hooks/artifact-guard.allow (and an un-ignore line below if needed).
*.zip
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.tgz
*.tar.bz2
*.jar
*.war
*.whl
*.egg
lambda-deployment.zip
lambda-function.zip
.terraform/
*.tfstate
